{"feeds": {"type": "feed", "id": "187347118949140480", "url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "title": "字节跳动技术团队", "description": "字节跳动的技术实践分享\n(wechat feed made by @ttttmr https://wechat2rss.xlab.app)", "siteUrl": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "image": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4Mz0zV5VtfHx3vA6LLNw3npTWibbGbYhtsc131DoN6m0A/0", "errorMessage": null, "errorAt": null, "ownerUserId": null}, "entries": {"feedId": "187347118949140480", "id": "1099377770762313728", "title": "《2025字节跳动企业社会责任报告》发布", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247519496&idx=1&sn=1a6f8a7d309951f0c0a7139625a1b1b5", "content": "<p><span>字节跳动技术团队</span> <span>2026-05-06 17:03</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">江苏</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5ee0e5f9&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FecBMoYjnmAfiaT1DeCvSX8yzibH2hh7okef52cuZ3GYdlKcqgoPIKF722xSLdFFSQ2hdybudrYgAKajYfyUmAYxqjqwmKsq84WlI%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>近日，《2025字节跳动企业社会责任报告（中国）》正式发布。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>过去一年，人工智能等前沿科技加速发展，并不断从技术创新走向场景应用。字节跳动既保持着竞逐未来、勇攀高峰的决心，更积极承担企业社会责任，以科技创造更多美好。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>在这份报告中，我们从共享科技创新、助力经济发展、焕发文化活力、增进社会福祉、守护绿色地球、创造可信生态六个方面，回顾了字节跳动这一年以科技实现社会价值的探索和实践。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>完整版报告可通过扫描文末二维码或点击阅读原文获取。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;line-he